| R6 | Peer re-reports and individual rounds (AC6) | Tests show the #134 scenario FAILs in both processing orders of round 4, with the peer's `unsupported` in place of `resolved`, and with round 4 run as two individual selection-tagged reviews; and the existing round-policy tests still pass | Any Pass condition is unmet or untested | `cli/test/round-policy.test.js` |
